model we
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "T, M3 C5, gate 8's walk/agenda.rs schedule_decision, a window-dated decision's end (E §4.1, §4.2, L §4.4; pick P29 on #175): the window's hole ends after the day's closing readings of its last day (stratum 2), and two such decisions' ends on one day apply by move id; a reading at the end of the last day and one the day after"

source fixture "T's fixture (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place jar: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input save_day: date

input spend_day: date

input put: money PLN

move save: transfers
  on save_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to jar amount if bal(konto) > put then put else 0.00 PLN

move spend: transfers
  on spend_day
  reads jar
  leg cash from jar to world amount if bal(jar) > put then put else 0.00 PLN

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  save_day = window(2026-02-01, 2026-02-10) "some day early in February"
  spend_day = window(2026-02-05, 2026-02-10) "some day in the first third of February"
  put = 100.00 PLN "a put"
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[jar] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start

version readings
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2026-03-01
  anchor konto
  anchor jar
  stated[konto] = 900.00 PLN at 2026-02-10 end "counted at the window's last day's end"
  stated[jar] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-02-11 end "counted the day after"

ask q_bal: bal(konto, d), bal(jar, d) for d in [2026-02-09, 2026-02-10, 2026-02-11, 2026-02-28] law cut

ask q_gap: gap(konto, 2026-02-10), gap(jar, 2026-02-11) law cut

ask q_flows: flows(konto, 2026-02-11 .. 2026-02-28), flows(jar, 2026-02-11 .. 2026-02-28) law cut
